{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07901","headline":"冬至後过吴张二子檀溪别业 · 孟浩然","name":"冬至後过吴张二子檀溪别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卜筑因自然，檀溪不更穿。\n园庐二友接，水竹数家连。\n直与南山对，非关选地偏。\n草堂时偃曝，兰枻日周旋。\n外事情都远，中流性所便。\n闲垂太公钓，兴发子猷船。\n余亦幽栖者，经过窃慕焉。\n梅花残腊月，柳色半春天。\n鸟泊随阳雁，鱼藏缩项鯿。\n停杯问山简，何似习池边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07901.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07901","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}